# .mallet/ is ignored machine-wide via core.excludesFile on some machines, but
# THIS repo commits its feature plans and project state deliberately — plans
# must stay visible across every branch. Re-include the directory, then ignore
# only the genuinely transient parts.
!.mallet/
.mallet/memory.md
.mallet/compact-snapshot.md
.mallet/pipeline-state/
